{
  "id": 370,
  "description": "Harakan Pirates | EST. 09/26/24 🏴‍☠️ #SailingTheSevenSeas #AdventureAwaits\n\nJoin the crew of Harakani, the Yonko of IdleMMO! 🏴‍☠️ #OnePiece #IdleMMO\n\nHarakan Pirates is a guild inspired by the spirit of adventure and freedom, much like the legendary Pirates in One Piece. We are looking for courageous and dedicated members to sail with us as we conquer the high seas of IdleMMO. Join us in creating an environment that is Strong, Loyal, and United, while striving to become the most formidable guild in the game!\n\n\nJoin Requirement\n\n•    Be active daily, contributing to our growth and success.\n\n•    Discord Required. (We use a custom bot for raid tracking and strategy discussions.)\n\n•    Combat Level 60+ to prove your strength and readiness for the challenges ahead.\n\n\nKick Conditions\n\n•    Offline for 4 days or more without prior notification.\n\n•    Any form of disrespect or immaturity will not be tolerated and is grounds for immediate removal from the crew.\n\nRAID TIMES\n6 PM UTC\n7 PM UTC\n\nPlease join our new discord channel. Since we passed lvl 40 we will start raids two times a day with discord we will be in contact and more \n\nhttps://discord.gg/2RZMr3AE2p\n\nSet sail with Harakani and the Harakan Pirates! Together, we&#039;ll rule the seas and reach the top of IdleMMO!",
